Why play Nethack.

..... I was a pimply computer room kid at a high school with a Digital
VAX 780 running UNIX. There were not so many options for games as
there are today. Lincoln-Sudbury Regional High School was a unique
place. We played Phantasia, Hack, Larn/Ularn, and of course Nethack
all day to avoid homework. I got hooked and still play 15 years later.
The school has changed alot and gotten rid of the VAX since then
unfortunatly. Even though I have only ascended once I still love the
game with all of its complexity. I havn't ever used an online server,
I don't have the patience and skills to make it onto a high score list
of that magnitude, so I wouldn't be showing off. But the pool of bones
would be nice for sure. I haunt this newsgroup occasionaly simply
because I enjoy helping newbies; and occasionally would have a
question or statement which can be shared only here. Who else would
understand my plight as a nethack player better than this small
community?



